abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for an empirical study of data-quality gating in
  lakehouse pipelines. Contains the natural-defect census, a corruption
  engine whose ground truth is recorded independently of detection logic, a
  cell-level comparison of four open-source validation tools under identical
  rules, and a downstream model evaluation with subgroup analysis, across
  three public UCI corpora.
